  "aciklama": "Comment CHINA and we’ll DM you the full setup guide + copy paste forecasting code.\n\n27,877 stars and 4,816 forks on GitHub. Accepted by AAAI 2026.\n\nKronos is the first open source foundation model built specifically for financial candlesticks. It quantizes raw OHLCV K line data into tokens, then uses a decoder only Transformer to forecast what comes next. Feed it 400 candles, get the next 120.\n\nThe part nobody’s talking about: you can finetune the whole thing on your own market data. Tokenizer and predictor, multi GPU scripts included.\nFree, MIT licensed, open weights on Hugging Face. Runs in a few lines of Python.\n\nOne honest note straight from the repo: the demo signals are raw predictions, not a finished trading strategy. Use it as a research tool.\n\nComment CHINA below. \n\nFollow @bestap",
